msgid "repeat a motion (``5j`` moves down five lines)"
msgstr "移動を繰り返す（``5j`` で 5 行下へ）"

msgid "start selecting by character (press again to stop selecting)"
msgstr "文字単位で選択を始める（もう一度押すと選択をやめる）"

msgid "start selecting by line"
msgstr "行単位で選択を始める"

msgid "copy the selection and leave copy mode"
msgstr "選択範囲をコピーしてコピーモードを抜ける"

msgid ""
"copy the current line and leave copy mode when nothing is selected "
"(``3yy`` copies three lines)"
msgstr "何も選んでいないとき、カーソルのある行をコピーしてコピーモードを抜ける（``3yy`` で 3 行）"

msgid "same as ``y`` with a selection, otherwise same as ``yy``"
msgstr "選択中は ``y``、選択していなければ ``yy`` と同じ"

msgid "copy the selection and stay in copy mode"
msgstr "選択範囲をコピーし、コピーモードを続ける"

msgid "open the search bar"
msgstr "検索バーを開く"

msgid "move to the next or previous match"
msgstr "次または前の一致へ移動"

